Subject: [PATCH 119/490] soh: rename func_800636C0 -> Regs_Init

Name source: zeldaret/oot (same decomp, same ROM address).
Structure verified against upstream at 0.92.
Defined in soh/src/code/z_debug.c.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 soh/include/functions.h | 2 +-
 soh/src/code/main.c     | 2 +-
 soh/src/code/z_debug.c  | 3 ++-
 3 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/include/functions.h b/soh/include/functions.h
index f8ceb5833..5e8848283 100644
